WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,640
We did promise Gu Shiyi to keep you safe

2
00:00:03,200 --> 00:00:05,040
But if you collude with Xiong Man

3
00:00:05,280 --> 00:00:06,480
That's another story

4
00:00:08,620 --> 00:00:10,020
It’s about the comfort of the building

5
00:00:11,020 --> 00:00:12,100
Must be cautious

6
00:00:37,150 --> 00:00:39,510
It seems that he was motivated to decide in advance.

7
00:00:39,950 --> 00:00:44,420
Big fish and meat are placed in front of you

8
00:00:44,500 --> 00:00:47,820
On the contrary, I think the pickles and porridge are more delicious.

9
00:00:48,850 --> 00:00:51,690
No wonder you guys haven't been able to defeat Xiong Man for so many years.

10
00:00:52,170 --> 00:00:54,530
How do you fight with a three-eyed man? What did you say?

11
00:00:55,610 --> 00:00:57,970
Have you finally revealed your cunning nature?

12
00:00:57,970 --> 00:01:01,060
If not, it’s Gu Cangsheng
